            "line": 320,
            "text": "theorem moment_ode {a z : ℝ} (ha : 1 < a) (hz : 0 ≤ z) :\n    a * z ^ 2 * moment a 2 z - (1 + 2 * a * z) * moment a 1 z +\n      a * moment a 0 z = 0"
